Grasslands is the first zone in the [[Fight|Fight Screen]], featuring 16 unique enemies. Defeating Keymaster Y at the end of the zone unlocks access to the next zone, [[Desert]], and a special zone, [[Vault]], that can be accessed once every hour. Additionally, clearing Grasslands counts as an important milestone that unlocks [[Ascension]] for your current run, and permanently unlocks the [[Portal]], [[Raids]], [[Crusades]], [[Perks#Blue Limbo Perk Tree|Blue Perk Tree]] and also [[Limbo]] once it's accessed for the first time.

Every monster in the Grasslands has a 1/240 chance to drop a unique [[Cards|Card]] which grant a special bonus when equipped, after which duplicate star cards of random rarity are dropped at the same rate.

